+# health_recover.dem — pp-funfix-118-124 (#124): the meter's RECOVERY path.
+# The health_lose unprepared shape (res <- rt -> host on narrows, era 3), but
+# the player FIGHTS BACK inside the drain: the streaming breach enters at ~84
+# (the D-2 first-delivery lag); the grace (900) expires at ~984 and the meter
+# drains 2/tick. The fix — demolish the narrows, place a second router
+# (clears the 5.6 separation; every wide span <= 18), 2 wides per leg (the
+# health_apply_fix shape) — lands at 40 s; the 200-tick measurement window
+# keeps the latch hot until ~1013, so the meter SCARRS to 40 before the latch
+# exits; then the all-clear recharge (+1/tick) heals the scar to 100 by ~1073
+# (53.65 s) and the run rides into the surge open. The one-way meter could
+# never tell this story: drain -> fight back -> heal, all in one run.
+# Captures (ticks measured from the stats stream — never guessed):
+#   capture 40000ms — the sprint lands (in-grace, the meter still 100)
+#   capture 50500ms — the TROUGH: mid-drain at the latch's exit (meter ~40)
+#   capture 56000ms — HEALED: the meter back at 100, pre-surge calm
+seed 4243
+run 60000ms
+era 3
+health on
+win surge 90
+fixture off
+spawn_node residential 8 15
+spawn_node router_basic 14 15
+spawn_node content_host 20 15
+at 100ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 100ms draw 1 2 standard
+at 40000ms demolish pipe 0
+at 40000ms demolish pipe 1
+at 40100ms place router_basic 24 10
+at 40500ms draw 0 1 wide
+at 40500ms draw 0 1 wide
+at 40500ms draw 1 2 wide
+at 40500ms draw 1 2 wide
+at 40500ms draw 0 3 wide
+at 40500ms draw 0 3 wide
+at 40500ms draw 3 2 wide
+at 40500ms draw 3 2 wide
+capture at 40000ms
+capture at 50500ms
+capture at 56000ms
+expect hash stable
